        "statement": "Subtract the common prediction. Since $(1+\\kappa)(a+b)-\\kappa v=d$, the correction $kZ_i$ satisfies (5) under the full path information. Lemma 1 certifies optimality.",
        "source_id": "SRC-029",
        "source_lines": [
