  {
    "id": "U",
    "name": "Proposition 2: Unequal sensor quality",
    "label": "prop:hetero",
    "eqs": "(23)--(25)",
    "contract": "Replace $b$ by $b_i>0$, retaining independence, stationarity, Gaussianity, and a common temporal rate. Define\n\\[\nC_i=(1+\\kappa)a+b_i[1+\\kappa(1-1/n)],\\qquad \\theta=n^{-1}\\sum_i C_i^{-1}.\n\\]\nThen $k_i=a/[C_i(1-\\kappa a\\theta)]$, $J_L=a-a^2\\theta/(1-\\kappa a\\theta)$,\n\\[\nP=(a^{-1}+\\sum_i b_i^{-1})^{-1},\\quad\n\\mu_P(t)=P\\sum_iY_i(t)/b_i,\\quad J_P=P.\n\\]\nThe hybrid action is $u_i^H=\\rho\\mu_P(s)+k_i[Y_i(t)-\\rho Y_i(s)]$ and $J_H=\\rho^2J_P+(1-\\rho^2)J_L$.",
    "source_start": 230,
    "source_end": 248,
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "U.1",
        "parent": "U",
        "goal": "G-U",
        "statement": "Substitution into (5) gives $C_i k_i-\\kappa a\\bar k=a$, where $\\bar k=n^{-1}\\sum_i k_i$.",
        "source_id": "SRC-034",
        "source_lines": [
          245,
          245
        ],
        "kind": "NORMALIZED",
        "support": "EXPLICIT",
        "deps": [
          "L",
          "A-U",
          "B-G"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "U.2",
        "parent": "U",
        "goal": "G-U",
        "statement": "Averaging $k_i=(a+\\kappa a\\bar k)/C_i$ yields the displayed coefficients.",
        "source_id": "SRC-035",
